{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q139160","formula":"C₂₀H₂₅NO₂","hill":"C20H25NO2","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":20.0,"H":25.0,"N":1.0,"O":2.0},"names":{"en":"Dienogest","ru":"Диеногест"},"descriptions":{"en":"Dienogest, sold under the brand name Visanne (manufactured by Bayer AG) among others, is a progestin medication which is used in birth control pills and in the treatment of endometriosis. It is also used in menopausal hormone therapy and to treat heavy periods. Dienogest is available both alone and in combination with estrogens.","ru":"Диеногест (торговые марки Визанна, Dinagest, Natazia, Клайра, Valette) — прогестин, доступный в комбинации с эстрогеном и в свободном виде в качестве орального контрацептива и для лечения эндометриоза. Проявляет прогестогеновую и антиандрогеновую активность, может улучшать симптомы андроген-зависимых патологий, например, акне."},"fame":17,"pubchemCid":68861,"mass":311.4,"charge":0,"smiles":"C[C@]12CCC3=C4CCC(=O)C=C4CC[C@H]3[C@@H]1CC[C@]2(CC#N)O","inchikey":"AZFLJNIPTRTECV-FUMNGEBKSA-N","iupac":"2-[(8S,13S,14S,17R)-17-hydroxy-13-methyl-3-oxo-1,2,6,7,8,11,12,14,15,16-decahydrocyclopenta[a]phenanthren-17-yl]acetonitrile","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"68861","atoms":48,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-4.368,"y":-0.066,"z":1.059,"el":"O"},{"x":5.859,"y":-1.416,"z":-1.102,"el":"O"},{"x":-5.522,"y":-1.884,"z":-1.772,"el":"N"},{"x":-1.927,"y":0.299,"z":0.889,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.083,"y":0.781,"z":-0.31,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.254,"y":-0.094,"z":0.169,"el":"C"},{"x":0.286,"y":1.351,"z":0.09,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.044,"y":1.681,"z":-1.082,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.142,"y":-0.833,"z":1.574,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.426,"y":1.026,"z":-0.892,"el":"C"},{"x":1.066,"y":0.282,"z":0.881,"el":"C"},{"x":0.267,"y":-0.377,"z":2.001,"el":"C"},{"x":